    ["一瓶非凡药剂，绿色的液体在瓶中缓慢流动，偶尔浮现出一些重叠的符号。"] = "Флакон потустороннего зелья: зелёная жидкость медленно перетекает внутри, иногда на поверхности проступают наложенные друг на друга символы.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛程安排</>\n四方联赛常规赛以<Highlight>两场比赛为一轮</>，每轮持续<Highlight>两周</>。\n在<Highlight>联赛新赛季前两轮</>，每轮在两场常规赛之外，<Highlight>额外增加一场附加赛</>。前两轮赛程为<Highlight>每轮2场常规赛＋1场附加赛，两轮共6场</>；附加赛仅限符合资格的神话组俱乐部参加。\n首场安排：开服<Highlight>第一周周日12:00</>根据俱乐部综合评判划分赛区、分组，<Highlight>当日18:00</>公示，<Highlight>当日20:00</>开启首场常规赛。\n后续常规赛于<Highlight>每周六20:00</>开启；附加赛时间见下方说明。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>常规赛规则</>\n每轮<Highlight>第一场常规赛</>开始前，本组第1、2名，第3、4名，第5、6名及第7、8名分别进入不同比赛小组，并在满足该规则的前提下<Highlight>随机分配</>。\n第一场结束后，各比赛小组<Highlight>前2名进入胜者组，后2名进入败者组</>。\n<Highlight>第二场常规赛</>分别进行胜者组与败者组对决，根据比赛结果确定本轮常规赛<Highlight>第1至第8名</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>新赛季附加赛</>\n<Highlight>参赛资格：</>以本轮<Highlight>升降级前的神话组名单</>为准。常规赛结束后应降级的神话组俱乐部<Highlight>仍可参加</>；本轮将升入神话组的俱乐部<Highlight>不参加本轮附加赛</>。\n<Highlight>战区组成：</>每个战略服赛季开始前，<Highlight>4个赛区组成1个战区</>，在同一战区内进行附加赛匹配，战略服筛选积分在各赛区内分别排名。\n<Highlight>对阵匹配：</>第二场常规赛结束后，<Highlight>同一战区内4个赛区</>的神话组俱乐部，按本轮常规赛最终排名匹配，<Highlight>相同名次的4家俱乐部</>组成一场附加赛。\n<Highlight>附加赛积分：</>根据<Highlight>本赛区神话组常规赛最终排名</>和<Highlight>本场附加赛名次</>共同确定获得的战略服筛选积分，具体分值见“战略服筛选积分”说明。\n<Highlight>比赛时间：</>于每轮<Highlight>第二场常规赛所在周的周日20:00</>开启，具体日期以赛事赛程为准。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>晋降级规则</>\n<Highlight>新赛季前两轮：</>本轮<Highlight>附加赛全部结算完成后</>，再统一执行联赛升降级。\n<Highlight>新赛季后续轮次：</>第二场常规赛所在周的<Highlight>周六21:20</>执行本轮升降级。\n各组升降级名次规则如下：\n<Highlight>圣名组及圣名组以上</>分组内前两名晋级上一分组，末两名降级至下一分组。\n<Highlight>英杰组及英杰组以下</>组内第一名晋升两组，第二名晋升一组，第七名降级一组，第八名降级两组。\n其中<Highlight>传奇组、史诗组、旅者组</>为特殊分组：传奇组第一、二名晋升一组，第六、七名均降一组，第八名降两组；史诗组第一、二名晋升一组，第七名降级一组，第八名降级两组；旅者组第一名晋升两组，第二名晋升一组，第七、八名降级两组；挑战者组第一名晋升两组，第二、三名晋升一组。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>战略服划分</>\n第二轮附加赛结束后，依次完成<Highlight>战略服筛选积分结算、联赛升降级</>。\n战略服赛区划分于<Highlight>次周周一</>、上述结算全部完成后进行，再进行势力划分；具体时刻以实际赛程为准。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>联盟组规则</>\n排名在旅者组之后的俱乐部将根据<Highlight>俱乐部非凡评分总和</>划分至<Highlight>挑战者组</>（前八名）及后续<Highlight>联盟组</>（<Highlight>联盟组不参与升降级</>）。联盟组的俱乐部将在每场联赛开始前<Highlight>自动匹配</>其它俱乐部组成联盟，以联盟形式参与四方联赛，联盟内<Highlight>所有俱乐部成员</>均可入场参战，联盟中<Highlight>排名最高俱乐部的会长</>将在局内自动获得<Highlight>联赛指挥权限</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛季重置</>\n每个新赛季开始时联赛将<Highlight>重新划分赛区</>，届时将按照<Highlight>上一赛季联赛成绩</>重新匹配对手构建新的赛区。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Tournament Schedule</>\nThe Four-Way League regular season consists of <Highlight>two matches per round</>, with each round lasting <Highlight>two weeks</>.\nDuring the <Highlight>first two rounds of a new league season</>, an <Highlight>additional playoff match</> is added to the two regular season matches. The schedule for the first two rounds is <Highlight>2 regular season matches + 1 playoff match per round, totaling 6 matches over two rounds</>; playoff matches are exclusive to eligible Mythical-tier Clubs.\nInitial Schedule: Clubs will be divided into divisions and groups based on a comprehensive evaluation at <Highlight>12:00 on the Sunday of the first week</> after the server opens. The results will be announced at <Highlight>18:00 that day</>, and the first regular season match will begin at <Highlight>20:00 that day</>.\nSubsequent regular season matches will begin at <Highlight>20:00 every Saturday</>; see below for playoff match times.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Regular Season Rules</>\nBefore the <Highlight>first regular season match</> of each round, the 1st/2nd, 3rd/4th, 5th/6th, and 7th/8th place teams from the current group will be placed into different match groups and <Highlight>randomly assigned</> while adhering to these rules.\nAfter the first match, the <Highlight>top 2 teams from each match group advance to the Winners' Bracket, while the bottom 2 enter the Losers' Bracket</>.\nThe <Highlight>second regular season match</> features matchups between the Winners' Bracket and Losers' Bracket, determining the <Highlight>1st through 8th place</> for that round of the regular season based on the results.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>New Season Playoff Matches</>\n<Highlight>Eligibility:</> Based on the <Highlight>Mythical-tier roster before promotion/relegation</> for the current round. Mythical-tier Clubs that would be relegated after the regular season <Highlight>may still participate</>; Clubs promoting to the Mythical-tier in this round <Highlight>do not participate in this round's playoffs</>.\n<Highlight>War Zone Composition:</> Before the start of each Strategy Server season, <Highlight>4 divisions form 1 War Zone</>. Playoff matchmaking occurs within the same War Zone, and Strategy Server screening points are ranked within each division.\n<Highlight>Matchmaking:</> After the second regular season match, Mythical-tier Clubs from the <Highlight>4 divisions within the same War Zone</> are matched based on their final ranking in the current regular season, with <Highlight>4 Clubs of the same rank</> forming a playoff match.\n<Highlight>Playoff Points:</> Strategy Server screening points are determined by both the <Highlight>final regular season ranking of the Mythical-tier in this division</> and the <Highlight>ranking in this playoff match</>. See the \"Strategy Server Screening Points\" section for specific values.\n<Highlight>Match Time:</> Begins at <Highlight>20:00 on the Sunday of the week of the second regular season match</>; specific dates are subject to the tournament schedule.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Promotion and Relegation Rules</>\n<Highlight>First two rounds of a new season:</> League promotion and relegation are executed uniformly <Highlight>after all playoff matches for this round have been settled</>.\n<Highlight>Subsequent rounds of a new season:</> Promotion and relegation for this round are executed at <Highlight>21:20 on the Saturday</> of the week of the second regular season match.\nPromotion and relegation rules for each group are as follows:\nFor <Highlight>Holy Name tier and above</>, the top two in the group promote to the tier above, and the bottom two relegate to the tier below.\nFor <Highlight>Heroic tier and below</>, the first place in the group promotes two tiers, the second place promotes one tier, the seventh place relegates one tier, and the eighth place relegates two tiers.\nSpecifically, <Highlight>Legendary, Epic, and Traveler tiers</> are special groups: Legendary 1st and 2nd promote one tier, 6th and 7th relegate one tier, and 8th relegates two tiers; Epic 1st and 2nd promote one tier, 7th relegates one tier, and 8th relegates two tiers; Traveler 1st promotes two tiers, 2nd promotes one tier, and 7th and 8th relegate two tiers; Challenger 1st promotes two tiers, and 2nd and 3rd promote one tier.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Strategy Server Division</>\nAfter the second round of playoffs, the <Highlight>Strategy Server screening point settlement and league promotion/relegation</> are completed in sequence.\nStrategy Server division occurs on the <Highlight>Monday of the following week</> after all the above settlements are complete, followed by faction division; specific times are subject to the actual schedule.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Alliance Group Rules</>\nClubs ranked below the Traveler tier will be divided into the <Highlight>Challenger tier</> (top eight) and subsequent <Highlight>Alliance groups</> (<Highlight>Alliance groups do not participate in promotion/relegation</>) based on the <Highlight>sum of the Club's Beyonder ratings</>. Before each league match, Clubs in the Alliance group will be <Highlight>automatically matched</> with other Clubs to form an alliance and participate in the Four-Way League as an alliance. <Highlight>All Club members</> in the alliance can enter the battle, and the <Highlight>president of the highest-ranked Club</> in the alliance will automatically receive <Highlight>Command authority</> for the league match.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Season Reset</>\nAt the start of each new season, the league will <Highlight>re-divide divisions</>, at which time opponents will be re-matched to build new divisions based on <Highlight>the previous season's league results</>.",
